"index_format_version":"3.0","schema_version":"1.0","captured_at_utc":"2026-10-30T10:15:00Z","snapshot_id":"BARROT-XRP-2026-10-30T101500Z-CIRCLE-COINBASE-PLATFORM-METRIC-CORRECTION","snapshot_path":"data/xrp_intelligence/snapshots/20261030T101500Z-circle-coinbase-platform-metric-attribution-correction.json","snapshot_blob_sha":"bdfc2e9297015e9872eff23eb836a5818b6de98f","snapshot_commit_sha":"d15f51657f0f3fc2e887a7630d277a19d6586ca7","snapshot_blob_sha_checked_at_utc":"2026-10-30T10:15:00Z","previous_snapshot_reference":{"record_type":"snapshot_reference","index_format_version":"3.0","schema_version":"1.0","captured_at_utc":"2026-10-30T09:00:00Z","snapshot_id":"BARROT-XRP-2026-10-30T090000Z-VISA-ADJUSTED-VOLUME-SOURCE-ATTRIBUTION-CORRECTION","snapshot_path":"data/xrp_intelligence/snapshots/20261030T090000Z-visa-adjusted-volume-source-attribution-correction.json","snapshot_blob_sha":"63b0ed40421e37649ef69ac87c86c3223a2923eb","snapshot_commit_sha":"a61f4c75f49cdb6725d9ffa8e4b75a77634f2bb9","snapshot_blob_sha_checked_at_utc":"2026-10-30T09:00:00Z","previous_snapshot_reference":{"record_type":"snapshot_reference","index_format_version":"3.0","schema_version":"1.0","captured_at_utc":"2026-10-30T09:00:00Z","snapshot_id":"BARROT-XRP-2026-10-30T090000Z-COINBASE-COLLATERAL-CIRCLE-VOLUME-VISA-ADJUSTED","snapshot_path":"data/xrp_intelligence/snapshots/20261030T090000Z-coinbase-collateral-circle-volume-visa-adjusted-xrp-market.json","snapshot_blob_sha":"f0d9d149ae345dcf39f2b1702b4301e1e27e8042","snapshot_commit_sha":"52a2dc489c697616753e0926c5cf40dd689ced5e"}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}},"source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030","SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"confirmed_facts":[{"claim":"Bitquery's 2026-10-30 on-chain investigation says the first Binance hot-wallet drain was on XRPL at 20:04 UTC on 2026-10-29. Five Binance proof-of-reserves-labelled XRPL accounts sent approximately 233.5M XRP to a newly created receiving account.","source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"],"evidence_class":"THIRD_PARTY_ONCHAIN_INVESTIGATION"},{"claim":"Bitquery's later chain read at 06:43 UTC on 2026-10-30 reports approximately 233.5M XRP still at the attacker receiver and says that receiver had never sent a transaction. This supersedes the earlier 03:54 UTC cross-chain balance cutoff for this provider's XRP observation; it does not establish the receiver's balance after 06:43 UTC.","source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"],"evidence_class":"TIME_BOUNDED_ONCHAIN_BALANCE_OBSERVATION"},{"claim":"Bitquery's report covers 17 Binance-labelled hot wallets across nine chains and estimates approximately USD6.3B drained, USD2.7B frozen or rescued and USD3.2B still with the attacker at 06:43 UTC. These are Bitquery's provider-specific scope and cutoff.","source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"],"evidence_class":"THIRD_PARTY_ONCHAIN_INVESTIGATION"},{"claim":"Bitquery says the XRP Ledger and Solana receivers share no address with the other chain clusters. Their association with the wider incident is based on timing, unusual transaction construction and Binance's aggregate damage estimate; the report cautions that wallet labels may be incomplete or incorrect.","source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"],"evidence_class":"ATTRIBUTION_LIMITATION"},{"claim":"Coinbase's Q3 2026 Form 10-Q reports, as of 2026-09-30, recognized lending collateral with fair value USD1,009.297M: USD11.740M fiat/payment stablecoins and USD997.557M crypto assets. The crypto total comprises BTC USD920.649M, ETH USD67.005M and other crypto assets USD9.903M.","source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"evidence_class":"PRIMARY_SEC_10Q"},{"claim":"Coinbase's Q3 2026 Form 10-Q reports USD3,284.562M of borrower-pledged lending collateral not recognized as collateral or as an obligation to return it: USD480.450M fiat/payment stablecoins and USD2,804.112M crypto assets. This is not Coinbase-owned liquid inventory.","source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"evidence_class":"PRIMARY_SEC_10Q"},{"claim":"Coinbase's Q3 2026 Form 10-Q reports USD434.163M of its own assets pledged against short-term borrowings: USD58.678M payment stablecoins and USD375.485M crypto assets.","source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"evidence_class":"PRIMARY_SEC_10Q"},{"claim":"Coinbase's Q3 2026 Form 10-Q reports USD301.943M fair value of recognized customer-pledged derivatives collateral, with BTC and ETH listed in the table, and states that collateral requirements were at least 100% of derivative notional value.","source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"evidence_class":"PRIMARY_SEC_10Q"},{"claim":"Coinbase's lending collateral requirements were 100% to 250% of the fair value of loans outstanding as of 2026-09-30.","source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"evidence_class":"PRIMARY_SEC_10Q"}],"derived_metrics":[{"metric":"Coinbase recognized lending collateral","as_of":"2026-09-30","usd_m":1009.297,"components_usd_m":{"fiat_and_payment_stablecoins":11.74,"bitcoin_fair_value":920.649,"ethereum_fair_value":67.005,"other_crypto_fair_value":9.903},"classification":"RECOGNIZED_LENDING_COLLATERAL"},{"metric":"Coinbase customer collateral not recognized","as_of":"2026-09-30","usd_m":3284.562,"components_usd_m":{"fiat_and_payment_stablecoins":480.45,"crypto_assets":2804.112},"classification":"BORROWER_PLEDGED_NOT_RECOGNIZED_NOT_COINBASE_FREE_ASSET"},{"metric":"Coinbase assets pledged against short-term borrowings","as_of":"2026-09-30","usd_m":434.163,"components_usd_m":{"payment_stablecoins":58.678,"crypto_assets":375.485},"classification":"COINBASE_ENCUMBERED_ASSETS"},{"metric":"Coinbase recognized derivatives collateral","as_of":"2026-09-30","fair_value_usd_m":301.943,"classification":"CUSTOMER_PLEDGED_DERIVATIVES_COLLATERAL"}],"inferences":["Coinbase operates several distinct institutional collateral pools. Recognized lending collateral, borrower collateral not recognized, company assets pledged against borrowings and customer derivatives collateral must not be summed as free liquidity or Coinbase-owned assets.","The Coinbase filing does not disclose XRP as a separate collateral line item. Its USD9.903M 'other crypto assets' lending-collateral bucket is not token-specific; XRP inclusion and amount remain unknown.","The Bitquery 06:43 UTC observation supports a latent XRP supply-overhang scenario only if the receiver subsequently moves or sells the tokens. No sale or transfer is established by that cutoff."],"competing_hypotheses":[{"hypothesis_id":"HYP-BINANCE-XRP-LATENT-OVERHANG-0643-20261030","claim":"The approximately 233.5M XRP held by the incident receiver at 06:43 UTC represents potential future supply overhang if it is later transferred to an exchange, broker or liquidity venue.","supporting_source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"],"counterevidence":"Bitquery observed no outgoing transaction from the XRP receiver through 06:43 UTC. No sale, exchange deposit or DEX swap is established.","status":"CONDITIONAL_RISK_SCENARIO_NOT_REALIZED_SELLING"},{"hypothesis_id":"HYP-COINBASE-XRP-COLLATERAL-USE-UNKNOWN-20261030","claim":"XRP could be included in Coinbase's aggregate 'other crypto assets' lending-collateral bucket, but the filing does not identify the asset composition.","supporting_source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"counterevidence":"No XRP-specific line item, units, balance or utilization is disclosed. The derivatives-collateral table lists BTC and ETH, not XRP.","status":"UNKNOWN_NOT_ADMITTED_AS_XRP_EXPOSURE"},{"hypothesis_id":"HYP-EXCHANGE-CUSTODY-DIVERSIFICATION-AFTER-BINANCE-INCIDENT-20261030","claim":"The Binance incident may cause customers or institutions to diversify custody and execution venues.","supporting_source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"],"counterevidence":"No matched customer migration, Coinbase inflow, exchange wallet delta or venue-level XRP balance series has been established.","status":"SPECULATIVE_NO_FLOW_EVIDENCE"}],"unknowns":["The XRP receiver's exact balance and transaction history after Bitquery's 06:43 UTC cutoff.","Whether all five XRPL source accounts are included in Binance's official October 1 XRP proof-of-reserves address set.","Whether Binance's XRP-BF2 backing address intersects any of the five compromised XRPL accounts.","Whether XRP is included in Coinbase's USD9.903M aggregate other-crypto lending-collateral bucket; no token-level composition is disclosed.","Actual Coinbase XRP collateral deposits, utilization, rehypothecation and liquidation volumes.","Whether Binance customer XRP balances migrated to Coinbase or another exchange after the incident."],"disconfirming_evidence":[{"claim":"The XRP and Solana receivers do not share an address with the other cross-chain attack clusters; Bitquery links them to the broader event by timing, transaction construction and aggregate Binance loss, not a common address.","source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"]},{"claim":"The Coinbase 10-Q does not identify XRP in its lending or derivatives collateral tables. Aggregate 'other crypto' is insufficient to claim XRP collateral acceptance or usage.","source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"]},{"claim":"No outgoing XRP transaction from the incident receiver was observed by Bitquery's 06:43 UTC cutoff, contradicting any claim that the 233.5M XRP had already been sold by then.","source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"]}],"market_observations":[{"observation_id":"MOBS-BINANCE-XRP-ATTACKER-RECEIVER-0643-20261030","as_of":"2026-10-30T06:43:00Z","asset":"XRP","reported_balance_xrp_rounded":233500000,"exact_five_source_transfer_total_xrp":233461943.1,"receiver":"rK21t6nGLy4MNDqhvy3pGwcLFy25qgfzMx","outgoing_transactions_observed":false,"source_ids":["SRC-BITQUERY-BINANCE-HACK-0643-20261030"],"feature_status":"EVENT_RISK_CONTEXT_ONLY_NOT_SELLING_FLOW"},{"observation_id":"MOBS-COINBASE-RECOGNIZED-LENDING-COLLATERAL-20260930","as_of":"2026-09-30","usd_m":1009.297,"crypto_collateral_fair_value_usd_m":997.557,"other_crypto_bucket_fair_value_usd_m":9.903,"xrp_specific_amount":"NOT_DISCLOSED","source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"feature_status":"INSTITUTIONAL_COLLATERAL_CONTEXT_ONLY"},{"observation_id":"MOBS-COINBASE-CUSTOMER-COLLATERAL-NOT-RECOGNIZED-20260930","as_of":"2026-09-30","usd_m":3284.562,"source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"feature_status":"NOT_COINBASE_ASSET_OR_FREE_LIQUIDITY"},{"observation_id":"MOBS-COINBASE-OWN-ASSETS-PLEDGED-20260930","as_of":"2026-09-30","usd_m":434.163,"source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"feature_status":"ENCUMBERED_ASSET_CONTEXT"},{"observation_id":"MOBS-COINBASE-DERIVATIVES-COLLATERAL-20260930","as_of":"2026-09-30","fair_value_usd_m":301.943,"listed_assets":["BTC","ETH"],"minimum_collateral_to_notional_pct":100,"xrp_specific_amount":"NOT_DISCLOSED","source_ids":["SRC-SEC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-10Q-20261029"],"feature_status":"DERIVATIVES_COLLATERAL_CONTEXT_ONLY"}],"market_features_admitted":false,"forecast_status":"NOT_ISSUED","data_quality_notes":["Bitquery reports nine chains; other incident investigators have reported ten-chain coverage. This is a provider-scope discrepancy, not silently reconciled.","Bitquery reports rounded 233.5M XRP at 06:43 UTC; the exact five-source transaction sum of 233,461,943.1 XRP is retained separately from the rounded receiver balance.","Coinbase filing values are reported in USD thousands and converted to USD millions in this snapshot.","Collateral categories have different ownership, recognition and encumbrance semantics and must not be added together."]}